  "integrationNotes": "v89 keeps other document viewers unchanged. Excel uses fixed, horizontally scrollable top sheet tabs, direct WebView touch ownership without document-page gesture/annotation layers, and zoom buttons. Android disableHorizontalScroll/disableVerticalScroll are false for spreadsheets so ACTION_MOVE reaches the canvas. Per-sheet viewport/zoom is remembered during the session. Viewport-only rendering, whole-column merge interval index, offline image rendering and cross-sheet Find remain enabled."
